OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into death of family
OL,4,Ain Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has opened into the death of
OL,7,Ffour family members who died after
OL,8,Fgetting into difficulty in the sea off
OL,9,Fthe coast of Shoreham.
OL,11,FHussam El-Khawas, 55, Zeina Alayan, 37,
OL,12,Fand their daughter Sara El-Khawas, 13,
OL,13,Fwere pronounced dead after being
OL,14,Fbrought to shore by lifeboat crews on
OL,15,F18 August. The couple's younger
OL,16,Fdaughter, Saja El-Khawas, died at the
OL,17,FEvelina Children's Hospital in London
OL,18,Fthree days later.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
