OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into death of family
OL,4,Ain Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior coroner Penelope Scholfield
OL,7,Fopened and adjourned the inquest to
OL,8,FMarch 2027 and offered her "sincere
OL,9,Fcondolences" to the wider family.
OL,11,FSix-year-old Saja was resuscitated but
OL,12,Fshowed signs of a brain injury
OL,13,Fthroughout treatment. No provisional
OL,14,Fcause of death was given for the other
OL,15,Ffamily members.
